{
  "note": "Written by hand. Events as opencode 2.2.5's server streams them on GET /api/event, after the adapter looked up each session's parent. A session created in the TUI, a turn with a shell permission request and its reply, a turn that fails, one the owner interrupts, a late duplicate of the answered request, and the session deleted.",
  "harness_version": "2.2.5",
  "events": [
